% A guard: a package of the writer's in TEXMFHOME loads framed and xcolor from TeX's tree, reads dvipsnam.def with \@@input and epsf.tex with LaTeX's braced \input, both from the tree, and english.apa from the tree with the primitive \input. english.apa gives its own name in \ProvidesFile, and no other file of that name is read. tex4ht keeps framed.4ht, dvipsnam.4ht, epsf.4ht, and english.4ht, and a named color keeps its value.
